  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born on the mean streets of the Bullies Block, Glitch developed a reliance on scavanging and tech skills to subsist in the harsh landscape. His AI enhanced eyes give him an edge, but the near constant malfunctions make every choice interesting in Subchain City. He joined a flock for 'protection', but really he just wants to find enough DRIP to keep his systems from crashing entirely.",
