    "personality": "Paranoid, Resourceful, Glitchy. Glitch trusts no one, often seeing enemies where there are none. He's a master of improvisation, turning scraps into deadly tools. His AI integration causes him to skip conversational beats, repeat phrases, and sometimes predict the future... poorly.",
